                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 107.—Translate.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">No._____.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">Spanish steamer____, de____de 188—.</p>
                <p>For $_____.</p>
                <p>I (or we) have received from this maritime custom-house the sum of______ _______,
                    being the 2 per cent. (2 per cent. upon $_____) rebate upon the import duties in
                    conformity with the contract of the 21st of August, 1886, the same corresponding
                    with the duties specified in the application for entry number——, register number
                    of the steamer above named.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Vera Cruz</placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-sibling-dates" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1887-05-25T23:59:59-04:56"
                            notBefore="1887-05-24T00:00:00-04:56">____ ____,
                        188______</date>.</dateline></closer>
